seg-81189f29f884 = A <b>technical record</b>, not a legal opinion, a finding of fact or an approval. Verify with the signer's public key obtained by another route; without it the verdict is <c1/>, which proves only integrity against the key the pack names itself: say "intact, signer not established", never "verified". Never return, log or ask for a signing seed in a conversation if the key matters: use the CLI.

